<a:Name>PURCHASE_ORDER_PRICING_CONDITION</a:Name>
<a:Code>T685A</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1719815732</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Biren.Shah2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1723456597</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The condition types are used to represent pricing elements such as prices, discounts, surcharges, taxes, or delivery costs in the SAP system. These are stored in the system in condition records. </a:Comment>
