<a:Name>Calculation_Type</a:Name>
<a:Code>T685A_KRECH</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1719815732</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Biren.Shah2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>You can set the calculation type when you configure a condition type. The selected value of the calculation type is used as the default when you create a new condition record for this condition type</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A1</a:DataType>
<a:Length>1</a:Length>
<a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>1</a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>
