<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Indicates whether the system calculates the scale base value or the condition value taking all related items of the business document into account.       For a group condition to be effective, the items must belong to a group. You can freely define the group to meet the needs of your own organization. The items can, for example, all belong to the same material group</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A1</a:DataType>
<a:Length>1</a:Length>
<a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>1</a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>
