{47E6A3AE-AA47-425C-AA05-CF089FE2BD43},SAP_Table_Name,5=T685A

</a:ExtendedAttributesText>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o760">
<a:ObjectID>505B683B-4A41-4048-B9DD-9098F2E90451</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Rebate_Procedure</a:Name>
<a:Code>T685A_BOVER</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1719815732</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Biren.Shah2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Leave the field blank for condition types such as material rebates where the rebate payment is based on sales volume. Accruals are then posted automatically every time you process a billing document which is relevant for the rebate agreement. The accruals amount posted is determined by the accruals rate defined in the condition record</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A1</a:DataType>
<a:Length>1</a:Length>
<a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>1</a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{930ED224-E528-44BB-9634-E758B0B77368},Shell_Attribute_Properties,126={F1CC8296-4560-4EC5-9345-1B45E56FBDE2},SAP_Field_Name,5=BOVER
{47E6A3AE-AA47-425C-AA05-CF089FE2BD43},SAP_Table_Name,5=T685A

</a:ExtendedAttributesText>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o761">
<a:ObjectID>F5F327C3-61D6-48C7-B8DE-E5680079A0F0</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Pricing_Date</a:Name>
<a:Code>T685A_KPRDT</a:Code>
