<a:Creator>Biren.Shah2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Determines how the system calculates prices, discounts or surcharges for a period condition. The system can calculate a price in the form of an absolute amount or as a percentage relating to a quantity, a volume, or a weight, for example</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A1</a:DataType>
<a:Length>1</a:Length>
<a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>1</a:LogicalAttribute.Mandatory>
