<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Allows the supplier for delivery costs to be entered subsequently. (&quot;Subsequently&quot; means not in the purchase order but at the time of goods receipt.)</a:Comment>
