<o:EntityAttribute Id="o777">
<a:ObjectID>7696F86D-59AC-4CA9-8377-B1A5C2AC7214</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Relevance_Account_Assignment</a:Name>
<a:Code>T685A_KTREL</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1719815732</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Biren.Shah2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Account assignment using an accounting indicator is often used in Service Management. It enables you to identify how costs incurred by a particular service transaction arose (for example, goodwill, under guarantee</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A1</a:DataType>
<a:Length>1</a:Length>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{930ED224-E528-44BB-9634-E758B0B77368},Shell_Attribute_Properties,126={F1CC8296-4560-4EC5-9345-1B45E56FBDE2},SAP_Field_Name,5=KTREL
{47E6A3AE-AA47-425C-AA05-CF089FE2BD43},SAP_Table_Name,5=T685A

</a:ExtendedAttributesText>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o778">
<a:ObjectID>5F8AAC96-52E1-4C72-B279-ACCB9E7AFD36</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Copy_Delivery_Costs</a:Name>
<a:Code>T685A_BNKTK</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1719815732</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Biren.Shah2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Using this indicator you can set the system so that the delivery costs are determined during the goods receipt posting from the existing shipment cost documents.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A1</a:DataType>
<a:Length>1</a:Length>
