<a:Name>Condition_Function</a:Name>
<a:Code>T685A_PURP</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1719815732</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Biren.Shah2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>By selecting a specific condition function for a condition type, you assign the business purpose of the respective condition function to this condition type. You do this to configure which customer-specific condition type the system uses for specific business purposes, for example, during pricing</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A4</a:DataType>
<a:Length>4</a:Length>
