<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Defines from where the price master data are derived during pricing in a business transaction in SAP CRM
You must define this field only when the following applies:
The SAP S/4HANA system is connected to an SAP CRM system
</a:Comment>
