<o:EntityAttribute Id="o789">
<a:ObjectID>2CA328AE-6501-4C72-868E-6A7D11333259</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Agreed_Conversion_Factors_Allowed</a:Name>
<a:Code>T685A_IS_QTYCNVFCT_ENABLED</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1719815732</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Biren.Shah2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>If you select this indicator in Customizing for condition types, you can assign an agreed conversion factor to this condition in a business document. During pricing, the system calculates the condition by applying the conversion factor..</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A1</a:DataType>
<a:Length>1</a:Length>
