{47E6A3AE-AA47-425C-AA05-CF089FE2BD43},SAP_Table_Name,5=T685A

</a:ExtendedAttributesText>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o795">
<a:ObjectID>A5FACE7E-CE1A-4DAD-9330-BD201AA68019</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Report_Number</a:Name>
<a:Code>T685A_OIREPORT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1719815732</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Biren.Shah2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>This field determines the report used to carry out second level pricing analysis. The default IS-Oil report is ROICANAL. The report number is specified per condition type in table T685A. That is done at detail level in the &#39;F&amp;A pricing analysis&#39; section</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A8</a:DataType>
<a:Length>8</a:Length>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{930ED224-E528-44BB-9634-E758B0B77368},Shell_Attribute_Properties,129={F1CC8296-4560-4EC5-9345-1B45E56FBDE2},SAP_Field_Name,8=OIREPORT
{47E6A3AE-AA47-425C-AA05-CF089FE2BD43},SAP_Table_Name,5=T685A

</a:ExtendedAttributesText>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o796">
<a:ObjectID>76E4C3D5-2E21-46EE-A8F8-C2EBB62E8B88</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Header_Format_Routine</a:Name>
<a:Code>T685A_OIHEAD</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1719815732</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Biren.Shah2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>This routine defines the format of the header section of the second level pricing analysis report. The routine is maintained using transaction O5F5. The field cannot be used unless the calculation type defines the condition type as &quot;Formula and Average&quot;.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>N3</a:DataType>
<a:Length>3</a:Length>
