</a:ExtendedAttributesText>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o798">
<a:ObjectID>B84477AF-FB49-476C-A659-17D5130E4C4E</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Error_Handling_Routine</a:Name>
<a:Code>T685A_OIERRHAN</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1719815732</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Biren.Shah2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>This routine defines how the system will handle errors during the second level pricing analysis. The routine is maintained using transaction O5F5</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>N3</a:DataType>
<a:Length>3</a:Length>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{930ED224-E528-44BB-9634-E758B0B77368},Shell_Attribute_Properties,129={F1CC8296-4560-4EC5-9345-1B45E56FBDE2},SAP_Field_Name,8=OIERRHAN
{47E6A3AE-AA47-425C-AA05-CF089FE2BD43},SAP_Table_Name,5=T685A

</a:ExtendedAttributesText>
</o:EntityAttribute>
<o:EntityAttribute Id="o799">
<a:ObjectID>269C79D7-AA7B-4A0C-BD05-2DC8D09ED33D</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Split_Invoice_Verification</a:Name>
<a:Code>T685A_OIA_SPLTIV</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1719815732</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Biren.Shah2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The indicator can/must be maintained at the following levels:
1. Condition type definition in Customizing (optional)
2. Vendor master (optional)
3. Purchase order item (mandatory)
4. Purchase order condition (mandatory)
You do not have to set the indicator in the material price conditions.
Select only the conditions you would like to separate from the material value</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A1</a:DataType>
<a:Length>1</a:Length>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{930ED224-E528-44BB-9634-E758B0B77368},Shell_Attribute_Properties,132={F1CC8296-4560-4EC5-9345-1B45E56FBDE2},SAP_Field_Name,10=OIA_SPLTIV
{47E6A3AE-AA47-425C-AA05-CF089FE2BD43},SAP_Table_Name,5=T685A

</a:ExtendedAttributesText>
</o:EntityAttribute>
