<a:Name>Material_Price_Group</a:Name>
<a:Code>T685A_WTY_KONDM</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1719815732</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Biren.Shah2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1719815732</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>You can create condition records for a material price group using the following condition types:
•	Material price group (for example, all non-food products)
•	A combination of customer and material price group
•	A combination of customer price group and material price group (for example, all wholesale customers and all non-food products)</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A2</a:DataType>
<a:Length>2</a:Length>
