<a:Name>DISTRIBUTION_CHANNEL</a:Name>
<a:Code>TVTW</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1621516461</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Laban.Plant</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1724650482</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Distribution Channels are channels through which Saleable Materials or Services reach customers, and could include Wholesale, Retail, or Direct Sales. They can be assigned to 1 or more Sales Organizations.

There will be a single Distribution Channel to support the Group Services &amp; Recoveries (GSR) processes. The remaining design is work-in-progress.

SAP table: TVTW</a:Comment>
