<o:Entity Id="o251">
<a:ObjectID>B6ED8899-759A-4CA3-A055-1284C0CC305A</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>SALES_ORGANISATION</a:Name>
<a:Code>TVKO</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1690358184</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Sridhar.Yilapavanam2</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1724650482</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Sales Orgs. are organizational units within Logistics that structure the company according to its sales requirements. They are responsible for the sales and distribution of both goods and services.
A Sales Org. represents the selling unit as a legal entity. It is responsible for product guarantees and other rights to recourse. It is a mandatory input to all sales documents, hence is therefore for all basic functions of SAP SD.

SAP table: TVKO</a:Comment>
