<a:ModificationDate>1723798215</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A partner of interest to the enterprise. A Business Partner is either an individual, i.e. a person, an organisation or a group that is not defined as a formal organisation.
</a:Comment>
<a:Generated>0</a:Generated>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil Calibri;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.17763}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\f0\fs22 Business Partner is the party with whom we have a business interest.\par

\pard Business Partners can be Accounts, Contacts &amp; Employees.\cf0\f1\fs20\par
}
</a:Description>
