<o:EntityAttribute Id="o937">
<a:ObjectID>8FC63F52-9FBE-498A-BFD0-49051B172814</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Central_Archive_Flag</a:Name>
<a:Code>BUT000_XDELE</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1620131798</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Shrishail.Hiremath</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1702549387</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Marcel.Kraan</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Establishes if the business partner is meant to be archived.

If the indicator is set, the relevant business partner can be archived from the view of the business partner administration.
If the check of the data to be archived shows, for example, that there are still active business transactions the archiving of the business partner data is prevented even if the indicator is set.

If the indicator is not set, the business partner will not be taken into consideration during archiving.
</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A1</a:DataType>
<a:Length>1</a:Length>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{930ED224-E528-44BB-9634-E758B0B77368},Shell_Attribute_Properties,127={F1CC8296-4560-4EC5-9345-1B45E56FBDE2},SAP_Field_Name,5=XDELE
{47E6A3AE-AA47-425C-AA05-CF089FE2BD43},SAP_Table_Name,6=BUT000

</a:ExtendedAttributesText>
</o:EntityAttribute>
