<o:EntityAttribute Id="o940">
<a:ObjectID>CEED2E34-1441-4774-A706-DBF2D180A8F5</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Salutation</a:Name>
<a:Code>BUT000_TITLE_LET</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1620131798</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Shrishail.Hiremath</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1702549387</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Marcel.Kraan</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Here you can define individual salutations (phrase of greeting) in letters. These can be used in place of a generated salutation, as required. You have to adapt the relevant print programs accordingly.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A50</a:DataType>
<a:Length>50</a:Length>
