<o:EntityAttribute Id="o941">
<a:ObjectID>BE13EACA-87EB-4ED3-AAEA-5AE0881D30F4</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Logical_System_Name</a:Name>
<a:Code>BUT000_BU_LOGSYS</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1620131798</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Shrishail.Hiremath</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1702549387</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Marcel.Kraan</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A system in which applications run integrated on a shared data basis.

The distribution of data between systems requires that each system in the network has a unique identification. The logical system is used for this purpose.
</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>A10</a:DataType>
<a:Length>10</a:Length>
