<o:Entity Id="o233">
<a:ObjectID>85C11530-B34C-4FC4-88A3-353686A26B88</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>PLANT</a:Name>
<a:Code>T001W</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1651645495</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Marcel.Kraan</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1724650482</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Biren.Shah2</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>In SAP, Plant is an independent and highest organizational unit in the MM module. It can be an operational unit or manufacturing unit or a sales branch of an organization. From a material management view, a plant can be defined as a location that holds valued stock.
The plant is responsible for planning, procurement, distribution of goods &amp; services to customers or other resources of an organization under one company code.
</a:Comment>
